@startuml
title Storage Routing - L2 Nested Route Scope
actor Caller
participant ThreadLocalStorageRouteContext as C
Caller -> C : open(routeA)
C --> Caller : scopeA
Caller -> C : current()
C --> Caller : routeA
Caller -> C : open(routeB)
C --> Caller : scopeB (previous=scopeA)
Caller -> C : current()
C --> Caller : routeB
Caller -> C : scopeB.close()
C -> C : restore scopeA
Caller -> C : scopeA.close()
C -> C : ThreadLocal.remove()
note right
跨线程 close 或非 LIFO close 会抛 StorageRoutingException。
嵌套 Scope 不代表嵌套事务。
end note
@enduml
